OL,3,GNEWSAStation entrance plans approved
OL,4,Aafter changes made
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to upgrade a seaside railway
OL,7,Fstation's entrance have been approved
OL,8,Fafter changes to the initial proposal
OL,9,Fwere made.
OL,11,FThe project will see new seating, a
OL,12,Ftaxi rank, a pedestrian plaza and
OL,13,Faccessible parking at Scarborough
OL,14,FStation.
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire councillors previously
OL,17,Fdeferred a decision on the plans in
OL,18,FAugust over concerns about passenger
OL,19,Fdrop-off arrangements and pedestrian
OL,20,Fsafety.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
